                {
                    "citation": "Yeager.ai. 2023: AI Agent Kryptonite - Prompt Saturation and Context Bleeding. Medium. Julkaistu 16.10.2023. [Verkkojulkaisu]. Saatavilla: https://medium.com/yeagerai/ai-agent-kryptonite-prompt-saturation-and-context-bleeding-4db7c4329e4e. [Haettu 16.11.2025].",
                    "link": "https://medium.com/yeagerai/ai-agent-kryptonite-prompt-saturation-and-context-bleeding-4db7c4329e4e",
